'@startuml
skinparam linetype ortho

actor "用户/管理员" as UA

frame "前端层" {
  component "Flutter / Web" as FE
}

frame "后端层" {
  component "Spring Boot" as BE
}

frame "基础设施层" {
  database "PostgreSQL" as DB
  component "Redis" as CACHE
  component "Mock 支付网关" as MOCK
}

UA --> FE
FE -right-> BE : REST API (HTTPS)
BE -down-> DB : JDBC/JPA
BE -right-> MOCK : HTTP 回调
BE -down-> CACHE : 会话/缓存

note right of MOCK
  **支付模拟器说明**
  - 当前阶段: 始终返回 success
  - 后期扩展: failed / timeout
  - 回调带模拟签名
  - 后端需设计幂等处理
end note
@enduml